 Header Metadata:
 Form Number: (DHA-1738) Form 8  
 Document Title: APPLICATION FOR VISA TO TEMPORARILY SOJOURN IN THE REPUBLIC  
 Issuing Authority: Department of Home Affairs, Republic of South Africa  
 Legal Basis: Section 10(2)(c) to (k); Regulation 9(1)  
 Category Selection (Checkboxes):
 Visitor's visa, Study Visa (> 3 months), Business Visa, Exchange Visa, Treaty Visa, Work Visa: Critical Skills, Relative's Visa, Work Visa: General, Medical Treatment Visa, Work Visa: Intra-company transfer, Retired Person's Visa.  
 Section 1: Personal Details:
 Title (Mr, Ms, Other)  
 Surname/Family name & Given names  
 Maiden name & Stage name  
 Previous/alternative name(s)/aliases  
 Date of birth (Year, Month, Day) & Place of birth (Town/City, Country)  
 Marital status: Never married, Separated, Legally recognised spousal relationship, Married, Widowed, Customary union, Divorced  
 If separated: Divorce proceedings instituted & expected decree date  
 If divorced: Date of divorce (divorce order attachment required)  
 Section 2: Citizenship Details:
 Present country of citizenship  
 Non-birth acquisition date and conditions  
 Other citizenship held (Yes/No) and country details  
 Section 3: Passport Details:
 Passport number, Date of issue, Country of issue, Expiry date  
 Other government-required document: Type, Number, Expiry date  
 Section 4: Addresses & Contacts:
 Residential address & Postal code  
 Postal address & Postal code  
 Country of usual residence if different  
 Telephone Nos. (Work, Home)  
 10-year residency history: Address, Period, Country  
 Right of re-entry into country of origin/residence (Yes/No, details)  
 Asylum/refugee status history (Yes/No, country)  
 Local contact person: Relationship (Friend, Business Associate, Relative, Other), Name, Address, Work/Home Phone  
 Relatives/friends in South Africa: Name, Address, Relationship, Identity No  
 Section 5: Intentions / Proposed Stay:
 Departure for SA: Proposed date and place  
 Arrival in SA: Anticipated date and place  
 Travel mode (Air, Road, Rail, Sea) & Carrier  
 Intended duration of stay (Days/weeks/months/years) & Intended departure date  
 Proposed activities outline  
 Section 6: Maintenance / Deportation:
 Available funds: Foreign currency type, amount, ZAR equivalent  
 Onward/return ticket number & Expiry date  
 Other financial arrangements  
 Section 7: Family / Dependants:
 Accompanying dependants table: Full names, Date of birth, Relationship, Passport No., Expiry date, Nationality, Occupation  
 Non-accompanying dependants entering later (Yes/No, date, reasons)  
 Prior refusal of entry or deportation details  
 Section 8: Security / Health Questionnaire (Yes/No):
 Criminal convictions  
 Pending criminal/civil cases  
 Tuberculosis or contagious disease / physical or mental deficiency  
 Unrehabilitated insolvent  
 Judicially declared incompetent  
 Member/adherent of organization practicing social violence or racial hatred  
 Affirmative details field  
 Sections 9 & 10: Additional Information & Declaration:
 Additional information field  
 Applicant signature & Date  
 Supporting Document Checklists:
 Standard checklist (Passport, Yellow fever, Medical, Radiological, Marital/Spousal, Divorce, Parental rights, Police clearances)  
 Category-specific checklists: Study Visa, Treaty Visa, Business Visa (new/existing), Medical Treatment Visa, Relative's Visa, General Work Visa, Critical Skills Work Visa, Intra-company Transfer Work Visa, Retired Person Visa, Exchange Visa.  
 For Official Use Only:
 Office of application, Date received, Quality check details, Passport handling, Fee/Receipt details, Track & Trace Ref No, Head office routing, Final decision and conditions/refusal reasons.

